# Repository ownership
#
# This project operates the v2.x solo-maintainer security profile.
# Keep source, tests, documentation, workflows, template configuration, release,
# and security/governance files owned by the repository maintainer until a
# broader maintainer group is intentionally documented.
#
# Branch protection uses Code Owner review for owned-path changes. External or
# automation-authored pull requests must receive maintainer review. A sole Code Owner
# cannot independently approve their own pull request, so any administrative bypass
# is constrained by docs/articles/repository-security-profile.md and is not a routine
# direct-push path. Stale approvals are dismissed after reviewable changes.

